Files used to fit to hospitalization data using models 1-7.

run_behavior_genbeta.R:       Model with immunity, vaccination, and human behavior 
run_humimm_genbeta.R:         Model with immunity, vaccination, and humidity
run_humtempimm_genbeta.R:     Model with immunity, vaccination, humidity, and temperature 
run_humtempimmvar_genbeta.R:  Model with immunity, vaccination, humidity, temperature, and variants
run_imm_genbeta.R:            Model with immunity and vaccination
run_mega_genbeta.R:           Model with immunity, vaccination, humidity, temperature, variants, and human behavior 
run_tempimm_genbeta.R:        Model with immunity, vaccination, and temperature
